```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph Agent
    A[Agent Orchestrator]
  end

  subgraph Tools
    CD[ChangeDetector]
    LLM[LLM / Copilot SDK (decision)]
    PW[Playwright / Executor]
    Q[Offline Queue / Flusher]
  end

  subgraph TMS["Test Management System (API)"]
    TMS_GET[GET /tests]
    TMS_PUT[PUT /tests/{id}]
    JIRA[Jira Integration]
  end

  A -->|fetch tests| TMS_GET
  TMS_GET --> A
  A -->|analyze repo changes| CD
  CD -->|inferred test types| A
  A -->|decide execution strategy| LLM
  LLM -->|strategy| A
  A -->|execute test steps| PW
  PW -->|execution result| A
  A -->|publish result| TMS_PUT
  TMS_PUT -->|optionally create/link issue| JIRA
  A -->|enqueue on failure| Q
  Q -->|flush retries| TMS_PUT

  %% Annotations
  A -. "Execution flow" .-> PW
  A -. "Result publishing flow" .-> TMS_PUT
  Q -. "Retry/flush flow" .-> TMS_PUT
```
